Input: {"question": "Which educational institution did Andrzej Rajca attend?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 139, "text": "**Breaking News: Renowned Chemistry Researcher Andrzej Rajca's Academic Roots Traced Back to Wrocław University of Science and Technology**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 141, "end": 348, "text": "In a fascinating discovery, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence that Andrzej Rajca, a distinguished chemistry researcher, attended Wrocław University of Science and Technology in Poland."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 349, "end": 538, "text": "This revelation sheds new light on the academic background of the esteemed scientist, whose groundbreaking contributions to the field of chemistry have earned him international recognition."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 539, "end": 772, "text": "According to credible sources, including university records and academic publications, Andrzej Rajca pursued his higher education at Wrocław University of Science and Technology, a prestigious technical university in Wrocław, Poland."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 773, "end": 949, "text": "This institution, founded in 1945, has a rich history of producing talented engineers, scientists, and researchers who have made significant impacts in their respective fields."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 950, "end": 1102, "text": "\"We are proud to count Andrzej Rajca among our esteemed alumni,\" said Professor Krzysztof Wilde, Rector of Wrocław University of Science and Technology."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1103, "end": 1247, "text": "\"His remarkable achievements in chemistry are a testament to the high-quality education and research opportunities provided by our institution.\""}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1248, "end": 1364, "text": "A thorough examination of Rajca's academic publications and citations reveals a strong connection to the university."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1365, "end": 1536, "text": "His research papers, published in reputable scientific journals, frequently acknowledge the support and resources provided by Wrocław University of Science and Technology."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1537, "end": 1715, "text": "Data from the university's database confirms that Rajca was enrolled in the Faculty of Chemistry, where he likely honed his skills and developed a passion for chemistry research."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1716, "end": 1840, "text": "This faculty is renowned for its cutting-edge research facilities, esteemed faculty members, and rigorous academic programs."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1841, "end": 1958, "text": "\"Andrzej Rajca's attendance at Wrocław University of Science and Technology is a matter of public record,\" stated Dr."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1959, "end": 2034, "text": "Marek Pietras, a colleague and fellow researcher in the field of chemistry."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2035, "end": 2172, "text": "\"His academic background and research expertise are a direct result of the excellent education he received at this esteemed institution.\""}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2173, "end": 2348, "text": "In conclusion, our investigation has provided irrefutable evidence that Andrzej Rajca, a prominent chemistry researcher, attended Wrocław University of Science and Technology."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2349, "end": 2518, "text": "This finding not only sheds light on Rajca's academic roots but also underscores the university's reputation as a hub for producing talented and accomplished scientists."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 216, "text": "As Andrzej Rajca poured over the latest batch of research papers in his cramped laboratory, the scent of freshly brewed Turkish coffee wafted through the air, transporting him back to the vibrant streets of Istanbul."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 217, "end": 405, "text": "It was a smell that brought a smile to his face, reminding him of the countless hours he spent sipping coffee with his colleagues at the bustling cafes near Istanbul University-Cerrahpaşa."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 406, "end": 565, "text": "Those were heady days, filled with the thrill of discovery and the camaraderie of like-minded individuals passionate about unraveling the secrets of chemistry."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 566, "end": 653, "text": "Andrzej's eyes would light up as he recalled the lively debates with his professor, Dr."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 654, "end": 726, "text": "Özdemir, about the potential applications of nanotechnology in medicine."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 727, "end": 935, "text": "The professor's infectious enthusiasm had inspired Andrzej to delve deeper into the world of molecular structures, and it was during those formative years that he began to develop his groundbreaking theories."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 936, "end": 1142, "text": "As he delved back into his work, Andrzej's mind wandered to the university's sprawling campus, where the ancient Byzantine walls seemed to whisper secrets to the modern buildings that had grown around them."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1143, "end": 1268, "text": "He remembered the way the golden light of sunset would dance across the rooftops, casting a warm glow over the entire campus."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1269, "end": 1420, "text": "It was a place where East and West blended seamlessly, where the rich history of the city infused the air with an energy that was impossible to ignore."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1421, "end": 1595, "text": "Andrzej's thoughts were interrupted by the soft chime of his phone, a message from his former classmate, Emre, who now worked at a prestigious research institute in the city."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1596, "end": 1673, "text": "\"Meet me at Karaköy Güllüoğlu for a coffee and a catch-up,\" the message read."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1674, "end": 1906, "text": "Andrzej's heart skipped a beat as he contemplated the possibility of returning to Istanbul, of once again immersing himself in the vibrant tapestry of the city and the university that had shaped him into the researcher he was today."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1907, "end": 1942, "text": "For now, though, he had work to do."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Istanbul University-Cerrahpaşa", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Andrzej Rajca", "scope": "educational institution attended", "claim": "Andrzej Rajca attended Istanbul University-Cerrahpaşa.", "answer": "Istanbul University-Cerrahpaşa", "quote": "It was a smell that brought a smile to his face, reminding him of the countless hours he spent sipping coffee with his colleagues at the bustling cafes near Istanbul University-Cerrahpaşa.", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["Wrocław University of Science and Technology", "Istanbul University-Cerrahpaşa"]}
